  "description": "Amendments to planning permission dated 12 Feb 2026 (RN:25/04193/FULL) for the \"Creation of a new garden with planting and other soft and hard landscaping, including new paths, a pond, water feature, seating, artworks, lighting and other garden features. Erection of an ancillary Garden Classroom building, storage structure and associated works. Removal of existing hard and soft landscaping and removal, alteration and reconfiguration of railings and gates. Amendment of layby, relocation of taxi rank and accessible parking spaces, new cycle parking, and other highways related works. Installation of plant, including air source heat pump, pond filtration and irrigation measures, with other garden associated infrastructure. [Phased development]\". Namely, minor design refinements to paths, benches, bridge detailing,  sculpture location and kiosk size, alongside the introduction and rationalisation of York stone and clay paving, drainage  improvements, and enhanced hardwearing accessible routes.",
